  "contentHtml": "<p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">1. </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">경기도 중등수석교사회에서</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">「</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">2023 </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">학교 밖 전문적학습공동체 나눔의 날</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">」</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">을 아래와 같이 운영하오니</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">, </span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160; 희망 교원이 참여할 수 있도록 안내하여 주시기 바랍니다</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">.</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">가</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">. </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">주제</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">: </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">나의 성장을 위한 미래 교육 페스티벌</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">나</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">. </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">일시</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">: </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">2023. 9. 2.(</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">토</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">)</span> <span data-ke-size=\"size18\">(</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">무료 및 점심 제공</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">)</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">다</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">. </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">장소</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">: </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">화성 푸르미르 호텔</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">(3</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">층 세미나실 </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">1</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">호</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">~5</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">호</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">)</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">라</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">. </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">대상</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">: </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">중등 교원 중 희망자</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">(</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">각 강좌별 </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">25</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">명 선착순 모집</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">, </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">참가자 개별 연락</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">)</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">마</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">. </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">신청 기한</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">: </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">2023. 8. 25.(</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">금</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">) 17:00 </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">까지</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">바</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">. </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">연수 교육과정</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">: </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">오전</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">(10:00~11:50), </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">오후</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">(13</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">:00~14:50) (2</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">강좌 선택</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">)</span></p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table data-ke-type=\"table\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" style=\"width: 100%;\" border=\"1\"><tbody><tr><td><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">연번</span></td><td><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">강의 주제</span></td><td><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">강사</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">(</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">수석교사</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">)</span></td><td><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">비고</span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">1</span></td><td><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">AI·</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">메타버스 타고 </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">go~</span></td><td><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">김용기</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">, </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">김정식</span></td><td><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">노트북 또는 </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">tab</span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">2</span></td><td><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">나도 논술형 평가 전문가</span></td><td><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">정경조</span></td><td><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">노트북</span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">3</span></td><td><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">AI </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">모델학습과 디지털교과서</span></td><td><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">강성현</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">, </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">고윤경</span></td><td><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">노트북</span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">4</span></td><td><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">IB </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">수업 모델 개발</span></td><td><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">김영학</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">, </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">이현정</span></td><td><br><br></td></tr><tr><td><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">5</span></td><td><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">평가는 이렇게</span></td><td><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">박경아</span></td><td><br><br></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">사</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">. </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">신청 방법</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">: </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">링크 접속 후 신청</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">(5</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">강좌 중 오전 </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">1</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">강좌 오후 </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">1</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">강좌 총 </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">2</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">강좌 신청</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">)</span></p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table data-ke-type=\"table\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\" style=\"width: 100%;\" border=\"1\"><tbody><tr><td><u><span style=\"color: #800080;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\"><a href=\"https://form.everestwebdeals.co/?form=1FAIpQLSdl0H67aOSWH5mTHu1CKfjXvl8zqacsHw-9fwiMu-0cEvOyCQ\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://form.everestwebdeals.co/?form=1FAIpQLSdl0H67aOSWH5mTHu1CKfjXvl8zqacsHw-9fwiMu-0cEvOyCQ</a></span></u></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table data-ke-type=\"table\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\" style=\"width: 100%;\" border=\"1\"><tbody><tr><td></td><td><br><br></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>9/2(토)에 뵙겠습니다!</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
